{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00805","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 撤豆 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 撤豆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笙镛洋洋，庭燎煌煌。\n明星有烂，祝史下堂。\n[笾]豆斯撤，礼容有章。\n克勤克俭，无怠无荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}